    },
    {
      "body": "- Look for \`InvoiceService.create\` errors on the \`billing_period\` field.
- Check subscription state transitions in \`billing_audit_events\`.",
      "contexttrail": "Source: docs/general/incident-runbook.md > Section: Incident response runbook > Common checks by domain > Billing > Part: 1/1",
      "id": "5a5ce6bf06b9d8af",
      "kind": "chunk",
