      "body": "\`WebhookDispatcher.retry\` re-delivers failed attempts on a fixed schedule: 1 min, 5 min, 30 min, 2 hr, 8 hr. After five failures the delivery is marked \`exhausted\` and no further retries occur. An alert fires when a delivery reaches \`exhausted\` state.",
